exports[`extraction snapshots of ten recorded pages > 02-blog-jsonld-zh.html 1`] = `
{
  "author": "李明",
  "bodyHtml": "<h2>示例市公交线路调整方案公布</h2><p>示例市交通局周二公布了新的公交线路调整方案，计划在明年春季前新增六条社区接驳线路，覆盖城市东部的三个新建居民区。</p><p>方案在过去一年中经过多轮公开征求意见，交通局表示，新线路将与地铁站换乘点衔接，平均候车时间预计缩短至八分钟以内。</p><p>部分居民在座谈会上提出，希望夜间线路能够延长运营时间，交通局回应称将根据试运行期间的客流数据再做评估。</p><p>交通局同时提醒市民，调整期间部分站点名称会发生变化，具体信息将在官方网站和车站公告栏同步发布。</p><p>专家认为，社区接驳线路能够有效解决“最后一公里”问题，但需要配套的道路改造与停车管理措施共同推进。</p>",
  "bodyText": "示例市公交线路调整方案公布
示例市交通局周二公布了新的公交线路调整方案，计划在明年春季前新增六条社区接驳线路，覆盖城市东部的三个新建居民区。
方案在过去一年中经过多轮公开征求意见，交通局表示，新线路将与地铁站换乘点衔接，平均候车时间预计缩短至八分钟以内。
部分居民在座谈会上提出，希望夜间线路能够延长运营时间，交通局回应称将根据试运行期间的客流数据再做评估。
交通局同时提醒市民，调整期间部分站点名称会发生变化，具体信息将在官方网站和车站公告栏同步发布。
专家认为，社区接驳线路能够有效解决“最后一公里”问题，但需要配套的道路改造与停车管理措施共同推进。",
  "canonicalCandidate": null,
  "hidden": [],
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "publishedAt": "2026-08-02T01:00:00.000Z",
  "title": "示例市公交线路调整方案公布",
}
`;

exports[`extraction snapshots of ten recorded pages > 03-xss-payloads.html 1`] = `
{
  "author": "Sam Baker",
  "bodyHtml": "

<p>A simple lemon cake needs flour, sugar, butter, eggs and two unwaxed lemons. Start by creaming the butter and sugar until pale and fluffy, which takes about five minutes with a mixer.</p>
<p>Beat in the eggs one at a time, then fold in the flour and the zest of both lemons. Click here for the glaze.</p>
<img src="https://news.example.com/2026/10/x" alt="cake" />

<p>Bake at 180 degrees for forty minutes, or until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Let the cake cool in the tin for ten minutes before turning it out.</p>

<p>For the glaze, mix icing sugar with the juice of one lemon and pour it over the warm cake so it soaks in. <a href="https://recipes.example.com/glaze" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Glaze variations</a>.</p>

",
  "bodyText": "A simple lemon cake needs flour, sugar, butter, eggs and two unwaxed lemons. Start by creaming the butter and sugar until pale and fluffy, which takes about five minutes with a mixer.
Beat in the eggs one at a time, then fold in the flour and the zest of both lemons. Click here for the glaze.
Bake at 180 degrees for forty minutes, or until a skewer inserted into the centre comes out clean. Let the cake cool in the tin for ten minutes before turning it out.
For the glaze, mix icing sugar with the juice of one lemon and pour it over the warm cake so it soaks in. Glaze variations.",
  "canonicalCandidate": null,
  "hidden": [],
  "language": "en",
  "publishedAt": null,
  "title": "Recipe: lemon cake",
}
`;

exports[`extraction snapshots of ten recorded pages > 04-relative-links.html 1`] = `
{
  "author": null,
  "bodyHtml": "<p>Version 4.2 of the Example toolkit improves start-up time by about thirty percent on typical projects and reduces memory use when many plugins are installed.</p><p>The configuration loader now reports the file and line of every invalid option. See <a href="https://news.example.com/docs/config" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">the configuration guide</a> and <a href="https://news.example.com/2026/migration/4.2" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">the migration notes</a> for details.</p><figure><img src="https://news.example.com/img/startup-chart.png" alt="Start-up time chart" /><figcaption>Start-up time compared with 4.1.</figcaption></figure><p>Deprecated: the legacy command-line flags announced in 3.0 are removed. Scripts that still use them should switch to the long option names described in the reference.</p><p>Thanks to everyone who reported issues and tested the release candidates over the past two months.</p>",
  "bodyText": "Version 4.2 of the Example toolkit improves start-up time by about thirty percent on typical projects and reduces memory use when many plugins are installed.
The configuration loader now reports the file and line of every invalid option. See the configuration guide and the migration notes for details.
Start-up time compared with 4.1.
Deprecated: the legacy command-line flags announced in 3.0 are removed. Scripts that still use them should switch to the long option names described in the reference.
Thanks to everyone who reported issues and tested the release candidates over the past two months.",
  "canonicalCandidate": null,
  "hidden": [],
  "language": "en",
  "publishedAt": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "title": "Release notes 4.2 - Example Docs",
}
`;

